["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Toast: Sticky SaaS - [Business Breakdowns, EP.247] net take rate SaaSpocalypse TAM MOIC flywheel market\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-29-breakdowns-行业15-的年流失率-反而成了toast抢份额的武器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f5791491c49c13a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">49:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Business Breakdowns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0529</span></div>\n<h2>行业15%的年流失率，反而成了Toast抢份额的武器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">每年有10万到12万家美国餐厅倒闭又重开，高流失率原本该是坏消息，却给了Toast这个挑战者源源不断的新客户入口，它靠产品优势正拿下其中约一半的新开业餐厅。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直SaaS</span><span class=\"tag\">支付处理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"罗永浩的X字路口！当一群情绪不稳定的杠精讨论起情绪稳定 POA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-29-cn2d7912-对方朝车窗吐痰泄愤-他说这证明自己更幸福/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e575a124b5b62c2b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:33:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0529</span></div>\n<h2>对方朝车窗吐痰泄愤，他说这证明自己更幸福</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「幸福者退让原则」是说：冲突时先判断谁更幸福，幸福的一方才该让——这套逻辑把躲在车里不还手，包装成了理性而不是害怕对方人高马大。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情绪管理</span><span class=\"tag\">脱口秀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"143. 对何小鹏的第二次访谈：更大赌注、人形机器人Iron诞生、那场意外、技术剧变下CEO、GX和缝合怪 VLA 缝合怪 SOP T1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-28-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-通用人形机器人99-99-会死-我们赌那两成胜率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/392e7ab9c3c64df9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0528</span></div>\n<h2>何小鹏：通用人形机器人99.99%会死，我们赌那两成胜率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鹏把花了小几十亿的自动驾驶体系整个停掉，因为用软件方法论加AI工具箱做出来的只是「AI缝合怪」。他给通用人形机器人的胜率是两成，而机器人创业难度是造车的20到100倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"142. 雨森的创投观察第2集：Harness、下一个字节、2026大机会和Stanley Druckenmiller Harness context engineering sandbox out of distribution agency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-27-zhangxiaojun-harness-才是操作系统-模型只是插拔的处理器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38abc82541e9f530-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:18:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0527</span></div>\n<h2>Harness 才是操作系统，模型只是插拔的处理器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司做的是提炼基础油的炼油厂，真正值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司。用户对 Harness 更忠诚——他会换模型，但不想换掉存着自己记忆的那个壳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">Harness</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Episode 195: Doug Cooke discusses NASA’s challenges in the space race to the Moon and Mars EDL (Entry, Descent, and Landing) cryogenic fuel transfer new space / commercial\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-21-stemtalk-nasa前高管-当前登月方案过于复杂-2028年根本无法实现/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/40c94fa1d0f627de-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">STEM-Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0521</span></div>\n<h2>NASA前高管：当前登月方案过于复杂，2028年根本无法实现</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">道格·库克认为，登月舱依赖未经验证的低温推进剂在轨转移与细高塔式结构，让任务成功率层层打折，中国的简化方案反而更可能先登月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航天</span><span class=\"tag\">NASA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"郑执×罗永浩！总是赶末班车的人，可以改进时间管理......也可以拥有一辆属于自己的车 匿名作家计划 万亩大造林\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-21-cn2d7912-三到五年内-ai将让零资源新导演和资深导演站在同一起跑线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c21e5eeeb2a439b8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:39:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0521</span></div>\n<h2>三到五年内，AI将让零资源新导演和资深导演站在同一起跑线</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">郑执说电影创作资源曾是有和没有之间零和一百的关系，但AI使实拍成本指数级下降后，没资源的穷小子和功成名就的导演会站在同一个起跑线上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">东北文艺复兴</span><span class=\"tag\">导演处女作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vanguard ETF mutualization 2&amp;20 / carry sales load\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-18-acquired-放弃全部利润-vanguard把自己做成了无法复制的对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b271b26bce642e3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:48:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0518</span></div>\n<h2>放弃全部利润，Vanguard把自己做成了无法复制的对手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vanguard的护城河不是规模或品牌，而是一个经济学悖论：想复制它的对手要么保留利润、放弃价格竞争力，要么降到零利润、无法持续运营。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指数基金</span><span class=\"tag\">被动投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"141. Freda的投资札记第2集：Tokenmaxxing、把电机塞进蒸汽机、接力赛变篮球赛、孤独、人的连接 Tokenmaxxing recursive self-improvement economic diffusion Neo Labs Acquire Hire\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-18-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代最稀缺的不是信息-是有人味的对话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86731af431732da4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0518</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代最稀缺的不是信息，是有人味的对话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当 90% 到 95% 的信息性内容都能直接问 AI 拿到，以信息交换为目的的对话正在被掏空，人和人之间剩下的只有情感连接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投资</span><span class=\"tag\">模型公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"李想×罗永浩！李想的理想：通过 AI 技术，让普通人也过上富豪的生活 具身智能 VLA 线控底盘 动态数据流架构\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-13-cn2d7912-理想要把富豪才有的司机管家生活卖给普通人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/37ee0608f621bf45-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0513</span></div>\n<h2>理想要把富豪才有的司机管家生活卖给普通人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李想判断，十年后买L4自动驾驶车和买家用机器人的会是同一批人——AI的价值不是替代工作，而是把富豪才雇得起的司机和管家，变成普通家庭也能消费的服务。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"140. 对姚顺宇的4小时访谈：请允许我小疯一下！在Anthropic和Gemini训模型、技术预测、英雄主义已过去 scaling law reward signal multi-agent VLA context management continual learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-是浪-冲浪的人不重要-模型大厂研究员的自白/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dddeb887e7c6825c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:50:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0511</span></div>\n<h2>AI 是浪，冲浪的人不重要：模型大厂研究员的自白</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">预训练没有到头，撞墙的人多半是自己有 bug；AI 本质是简单的，因为它能做实验。个人英雄主义时代已经过去，现在拼的是组织系统性和靠谱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型训练</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP3 安娜：人道救援十年，她说看见是改变的开始 HPV Labor Market DIC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-08-xiaotianzhang-决定产妇能否活下来的-往往不是医术-而是一条路-一笔钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2006c77d32fa5b8f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0508</span></div>\n<h2>决定产妇能否活下来的，往往不是医术，而是一条路、一笔钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她做了十几年战地妇产科医生后发现，救不救得活产妇常常不取决于医术，而是有没有路、有没有钱、有没有人签字——这促使她转向公共卫生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人道救援</span><span class=\"tag\">无国界医生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Rolex Oyster case rotor testimonee établissage Quartz Crisis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-03-acquired-石英表几乎团灭瑞士手表业-rolex靠的是等待而非创新/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ab663b0e688c62d9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">4:51:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0503</span></div>\n<h2>石英表几乎团灭瑞士手表业，Rolex靠的是等待而非创新</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">石英表几乎打垮瑞士表业时，Rolex没有跟风转型，而是等对手慌乱退场后，再用验证过的高端策略反扑，靠的是独立公司才有的耐心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">奢侈品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">瑞士制造</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Costco Cross-docking SKU Net 30\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-02-acquired-最便宜的零售商-却拥有全美最有钱的顾客/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b464597610793199-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:53:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0502</span></div>\n<h2>最便宜的零售商，却拥有全美最有钱的顾客</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Costco 把会员费和大包装门槛变成筛选器，挡住对现金流敏感的人，剩下的会员平均年收入12.5万美元，远高于沃尔玛顾客。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零售</span><span class=\"tag\">会员制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang – Will Nvidia’s moat persist? CoWoS MoE EUV Pareto frontier\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-01-ch-dwarkesh-patel-黄仁勋-电子变token的炼金术才是护城河-不是芯片本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8c114c28d369da61-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh Patel</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0501</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：电子变token的炼金术才是护城河，不是芯片本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋认为NVIDIA的护城河不在制造环节，而在「把电子变成token、让每个token更值钱」这件远未被理解透的工程；中国算力争论上，他和主持人就「卖芯片到底是帮美国还是资敌」正面互怼，谁也没说服谁。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NVIDIA</span><span class=\"tag\">CUDA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"U.S. Leadership in AI with Jensen Huang, Founder and CEO of NVIDIA, and Congressman Ro Khanna agentic AI frontier model token\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-01-ch-stanford-graduate-school-of-business-ai本该让放射科医生失业-结果这个岗位却越招越多/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/00b0938c3f538622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Stanford Graduate School of Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0501</span></div>\n<h2>AI本该让放射科医生失业，结果这个岗位却越招越多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋认为，工作的「目的」与工作里具体的「任务」是两回事：放射科诊断任务被AI彻底自动化后，医院反而雇佣了更多放射科医生去接诊更多病人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI产业政策</span><span class=\"tag\">中美科技竞争</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"139. 【Agent的综述】和苏煜聊Agent技术史、OpenClaw Moment、边界的消弭和社会的辐射 semantic parsing language agent world model continual learning cortical column non-parametric learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-01-zhangxiaojun-agent-的瓶颈不是智能-是它学不会成为专家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ac45bf92bdd9de7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:17:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0501</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 的瓶颈不是智能，是它学不会成为专家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通用智能已经够用且廉价，真正稀缺的是 specialized intelligence——让 agent 像实习生变成老师傅那样，持续学会某个小世界的 world model。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">持续学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"138. 对罗福莉3.5小时访谈：AI范式已然巨变！OpenClaw、Agent范式很吃后训练、卡的分配、组织平权 OpenClaw MTP MLA Hybrid-Tension Non-Colice Skills\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-24-zhangxiaojun-openclaw-让罗福莉改判-agent-框架能补齐模型短板/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9c4c5c5e555fef3f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:36:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0424</span></div>\n<h2>OpenClaw 让罗福莉改判：Agent 框架能补齐模型短板</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她最初觉得它只是个偏运营的壳，春节深夜装上后，它两天内接手了她的生活与研究；她由此判断：一套复杂的 agent 编排，能把中级模型的短板补到接近顶尖水平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">后训练</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Lewis and Clark, the Corps of Discovery, and Writing Collective History: Interview with Author Craig Fehrman Corps of Discovery portage NCO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-23-tides-刘易斯从未蓄养贴身奴隶-克拉克却因奴隶约克的自由而心生嫉恨/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2c973231cfe74cd3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Tides of History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0423</span></div>\n<h2>刘易斯从未蓄养贴身奴隶，克拉克却因奴隶约克的自由而心生嫉恨</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同样生在蓄奴州、同样是挚友，克拉克因奴隶约克挣脱卑躬屈膝而占有又嫉妒，刘易斯却终身没有自己的黑奴侍从。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国西进史</span><span class=\"tag\">奴隶制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"137. 对洪乐潼的4小时访谈：AI for Math、把数学变成Lean、数学天书中的证明、直觉、被创造与被发现的 ATP ITP Lean auto formalization groupthink\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-20-zhangxiaojun-ai-用几千行-lean-代码硬解普特南题-这不是智能的胜利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3d6c7e8a9f3635f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">4:24:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0420</span></div>\n<h2>AI 用几千行 Lean 代码硬解普特南题，这不是智能的胜利</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">普特南竞赛 98 年只有五个满分，AI 拿到第六个，但它没走人类那张图，而是用几千行 Lean 代码枚举硬算——自动定理证明这个领域在 AI 之前就存在了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Math</span><span class=\"tag\">形式化验证</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"携程梁建章×罗永浩！在企业家与学者之间，他选择了最艰难的“往返票” AI native\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-17-cn2d7912-不生孩子的家庭-其实在占生孩子家庭的便宜/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/07aed90696850fa3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:40:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0417</span></div>\n<h2>不生孩子的家庭，其实在占生孩子家庭的便宜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">梁建章的核心论断：每个孩子长大后的养老金和创新贡献由全社会共享，但生育成本只由父母独自承担——这正是他主张政府该拿真金白银补贴生育，而非单纯道德劝生的根本逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生育率</span><span class=\"tag\">远程办公</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"136. 全球大模型季报第9集：和广密聊，Coding是AGI第二幕、硅谷御三家真相、模型正成为新一代OS Harness Engineering Token Usage Solta model feedback loop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-14-zhangxiaojun-coding-是-agi-第二幕-没有领先的-coding-模型就像没有领先的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6add56ae20b47c40-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0414</span></div>\n<h2>Coding 是 AGI 第二幕：没有领先的 Coding 模型就像没有领先的 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司真正的分水岭不是 C 端 DAU，而是能不能组织几百个最聪明的人 all in 做数据这件脏活——Anthropic 赢在战略专注，OpenAI 输在什么都想要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Coding</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"“无聊斋” × 罗永浩的X字路口！喜剧工作者在AI时代可以多“活”几年\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-13-cn2d7912-罗永浩判断-喜剧是ai最后才攻克的文本门类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e062d003e2512a09-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:30:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>罗永浩判断：喜剧是AI最后才攻克的文本门类</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说自己问遍了几家顶级大模型，得到的共识是：脱口秀式一句一个梗的高密度喜剧文本，AI理论上能攻克，但注定排在最后，所以喜剧工作者比别的创作者能多活几年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">喜剧</span><span class=\"tag\">AI恐惧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ferrari Tifosi Classiche Purosangue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-13-acquired-法拉利-卖的不是车-是排他与包容的悖论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b28a1307f172ac6a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:59:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>法拉利年产1.4万辆，市值却超福特：卖的是排他，也是包容</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法拉利年产仅1.4万辆，市值却超福特。秘诀在于同时拥有奢侈品的排他性和运动队的包容性，用稀缺性制造神话，用社群维持忠诚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法拉利</span><span class=\"tag\">奢侈品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"135. 和自然选择创始人Tristan聊，Elys、赛博分身、灵魂、Context的获取与流动和AI社交网络 Context Proactive Agentic 商增\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-10-zhangxiaojun-ai时代唯一重要的事是做自己-社交网络要被重做一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/219fe489c3e71f04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0410</span></div>\n<h2>AI时代唯一重要的事是做自己，社交网络要被重做一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tristan 认为 AI 时代唯一重要的事是构建主体性——把 context 沉淀下来，让 AI 替你做社交里最无聊的商增，人只接管最重要的连接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI社交</span><span class=\"tag\">Context</span>\n</div></div></a>"]